{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05316","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 周利用","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出豫乘金节，飞文焕日宫。\n萸房开圣酒，杏苑被玄功。\n塔向三天迥，禅收八解空。\n叨恩奉兰藉，终愧洽薰风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周利用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}